&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; LGTM1 conditional on some summary of developer feedback from the first
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; OT. What did we learn? Are we making API shape changes in response? And why
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; aren't we moving to I2S yet (or is that anticipated in this extension
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; window)?
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;
