&lt;pre&gt;Can this be extended please?

I did present it at the IETF TSVWG (and asked for agenda time at the
upcoming one), list discussion is here
&lt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://mailarchive.ietf.org/arch/msg/tsvwg/Kuq5b8FrZe0kDDkFw6NY77QP6Ww/"&gt;https://mailarchive.ietf.org/arch/msg/tsvwg/Kuq5b8FrZe0kDDkFw6NY77QP6Ww/&lt;/a&gt;&gt;.
The big open issue is how this gets represented in the SDP.&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre&gt;

Positive deployment feedback from Microsoft here
&lt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/fippo/warp-snap-sped/issues/21#issuecomment-6308379637"&gt;https://github.com/fippo/warp-snap-sped/issues/21#issuecomment-6308379637&lt;/a&gt;&gt;
( improvement of 23% in P50 and 22% on P90 Transport setup latency),
positive mention in the OpenAI blog post
&lt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://openai.com/index/continuous-voice-interaction-with-gpt-live/"&gt;https://openai.com/index/continuous-voice-interaction-with-gpt-live/&lt;/a&gt;&gt; but
this more about native apps.

cheers

Philipp

