&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; It looks like the API owners accepted the interop risk when
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; approving
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/NqI9QfefGbo/m/RXADtpfRCQAJ?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer"&gt;https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/NqI9QfefGbo/m/RXADtpfRCQAJ?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer&lt;/a&gt;&gt;
