&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt; Can &lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/whatwg/bluetooth/pull/672"&gt;https://github.com/whatwg/bluetooth/pull/672&lt;/a&gt; be merged now that the
&gt;&gt; spec has moved to the WHATWG?
&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt; On Tue, Oct 27, 2026 at 7:56 PM Alex Russell &lt;&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="c7b4abaea0afe9e9e987a4afb5a8aaaeb2aae9a8b5a0"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt; wrote:
&gt;&gt;
