&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div itemprop="articleBody" class="msgBody"&gt;

&lt;pre&gt;Thanks all! The WebKit standards position request can be found here,
&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/738"&gt;https://github.com/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/738&lt;/a&gt;, and was swiftly
answered
&lt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/738#issuecomment-6638188575"&gt;https://github.com/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/738#issuecomment-6638188575&lt;/a&gt;&gt;
.
I've updated Chromestatus accordingly.&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre&gt;


