&gt;&gt;&gt; On Mon, Oct 19, 2026 at 7:21 PM Alex Russell &lt;&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="d5a6b9bcb2bda1b9acfbfbfb95b6bda7bab8bca0b8fbbaa7b2"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt;
