&lt;pre&gt;LGTM

On Tue, Oct 6, 2026 at 3:27 PM Chromestatus &lt;&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="c4a5a0eaeaea84a7b6e9b7b0a5b0b1b7eaa5b4b4b7b4abb0a9a5ada8eaa7aba9"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt;
wrote:&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;pre&gt;

&gt; *Contact emails*
&gt; &lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="9bfcb5b5b5dbfcf4f4fcf7feb5f8f4f6"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;
&gt;
&gt; *Explainer*
&gt; &lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/explainers-by-googlers/prefetch-activation-beacon"&gt;https://github.com/explainers-by-googlers/prefetch-activation-beacon&lt;/a&gt;
&gt;
&gt; *Specification*
&gt; &lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/explainers-by-googlers/prefetch-activation-beacon"&gt;https://github.com/explainers-by-googlers/prefetch-activation-beacon&lt;/a&gt;
&gt;
&gt; *Summary*
&gt; The on-prefetch-activation HTTP response header enables servers to specify
&gt; a telemetry endpoint that the browser notifies when a prefetched resource
&gt; is used for navigation. Developers gain a reliable signal to measure the
&gt; precision and performance impact of their prefetch strategies.
&gt;
&gt; *Blink component*
&gt; Blink&gt;Loader&gt;Preload
&gt; &lt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://issues.chromium.org/issues?q=customfield1222907:%22Blink%3ELoader%3EPreload%22"&gt;https://issues.chromium.org/issues?q=customfield1222907:%22Blink%3ELoader%3EPreload%22&lt;/a&gt;&gt;
&gt;
&gt; *Web Feature ID*
&gt; Missing feature
&gt;
&gt; *TAG review*
&gt; *No information provided*
&gt;
&gt; *TAG review status*
&gt; Pending
&gt;
&gt; *Origin Trial Name*
&gt; PrefetchAndPrerenderActivationBeacon
&gt;
&gt; *Goals for experimentation*
&gt; We are going to start origin trial for the prefetch activation beacon to
&gt; evaluate whether it can reliably report all the user navigation when the
&gt; page is prefetched. We will compare the DAU and the query count with a
&gt; group not using the API and reports activation via javascript.
&gt;
&gt; *Chromium Trial Name*
&gt; PrefetchAndPrerenderActivationBeacon
&gt;
&gt; *Origin Trial documentation link*
&gt; &lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/explainers-by-googlers/prefetch-activation-beacon"&gt;https://github.com/explainers-by-googlers/prefetch-activation-beacon&lt;/a&gt;
&gt;
&gt; *WebFeature UseCounter name*
&gt; kPrefetchAndPrerenderActivationBeacon
&gt;
&gt; *Risks*
&gt;
&gt;
&gt; *Interoperability and Compatibility*
&gt; *No information provided*
&gt;
&gt; *Gecko*: No signal
&gt;
&gt; *WebKit*: No signal
&gt;
&gt; *Web developers*: No signals
&gt;
&gt; *Other signals*:
&gt;
&gt; *WebView application risks*
&gt;
&gt; Does this intent deprecate or change behavior of existing APIs, such that
&gt; it has potentially high risk for Android WebView-based applications?
&gt; *No information provided*
&gt;
&gt;
&gt; *Reason this experiment is being extended*
&gt; Because of the shift to 2-week release schedule, the origin trial will end
&gt; earlier than our orignial expectation.
&gt;
&gt; *Ongoing technical constraints*
&gt; None
&gt;
&gt; *Debuggability*
&gt; *No information provided*
&gt;
&gt; *Will this feature be supported on all six Blink platforms (Windows, Mac,
&gt; Linux, ChromeOS, Android, and Android WebView)?*
&gt; No
&gt;
&gt; *Is this feature fully tested by web-platform-tests
&gt; &lt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/main/docs/testing/web_platform_tests.md"&gt;https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/main/docs/testing/web_platform_tests.md&lt;/a&gt;&gt;?*
&gt; No
&gt;
&gt;
&gt; *Flag name on about://flags*
&gt; *No information provided*
&gt;
&gt; *Finch feature name*
&gt; *No information provided*
&gt;
&gt; *Non-finch justification*
&gt; *No information provided*
&gt;
&gt; *Requires code in //chrome?*
&gt; False
&gt;
&gt; *Tracking bug*
&gt; &lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://b.corp.google.com/issues/499814382"&gt;https://b.corp.google.com/issues/499814382&lt;/a&gt;
&gt;
&gt; *Launch bug*
&gt; &lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://launch.corp.google.com/launch/4468679"&gt;https://launch.corp.google.com/launch/4468679&lt;/a&gt;
&gt;
&gt; *Estimated milestones*
&gt; Origin trial desktop first 151
&gt; Origin trial desktop last 155
&gt; Origin trial extension 1 end milestone 158
&gt; Origin trial Android first 151
&gt; Origin trial Android last 155
&gt; Origin trial WebView first 151
&gt; Origin trial WebView last 156
&gt;
&gt; *Link to entry on the Chrome Platform Status*
&gt; &lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5118934710878208?gate=5076236907970560"&gt;https://chromestatus.com/feature/5118934710878208?gate=5076236907970560&lt;/a&gt;
&gt;
&gt; *Links to previous Intent discussions*
&gt; Intent to Prototype:
&gt; &lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/d/msgid/blink-dev/CAJQw1NzrnJBU7pmpz7bfxK2G7cWUcJsaU9ekFHh3XKFUyzzrwg%40mail.gmail.com"&gt;https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/d/msgid/blink-dev/CAJQw1NzrnJBU7pmpz7bfxK2G7cWUcJsaU9ekFHh3XKFUyzzrwg%40mail.gmail.com&lt;/a&gt;
