&gt; On Wed, Sep 30, 2026 at 5:03 PM Rick Byers &lt;&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="b8cadac1969696f8dbd0cad7d5d1cdd596d7cadf"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt; wrote:
&gt;
&gt;&gt; LGTM1
&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt; As for the install API
&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/6pb1UvLMXko?e=48417069"&gt;https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/6pb1UvLMXko?e=48417069&lt;/a&gt;&gt;,
