&gt; *Sent:* Monday, September 21, 2026 11:40 AM
&gt; *To:* blink-dev &lt;&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="6f0d0306014141412f0c071d0002061a0241001d08"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt;
&gt; *Cc:* Giovanni Del Valle &lt;&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="6f080b0a034141412f02060c1d001c00091b410c0002"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt;; Brandon Maslen &lt;
&gt; &lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="bbd9c9da959595fbd6d2d8c9d4c8d4ddcf95d8d4d6"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt;
