&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; &lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/OLCCI0ExvIk"&gt;https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/OLCCI0ExvIk&lt;/a&gt;
