&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; wrote:
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; Hey Corentin,
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;
&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt; For those of us who are not in the WebGPU head-space all day, is it
