/WebKit/: Positive (&lt;a rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/gpuweb/gpuweb/pull/5610"&gt;https://github.com/gpuweb/gpuweb/pull/5610&lt;/a&gt; &lt;&lt;a rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/gpuweb/gpuweb/pull/5610"&gt;https://github.com/gpuweb/gpuweb/pull/5610&lt;/a&gt;&gt;) Specification approval constitutes a positive signal, per
