/Web developers/: Positive (&lt;a rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/gpuweb/gpuweb/issues/5071#issuecomment-2660636760"&gt;https://github.com/gpuweb/gpuweb/issues/5071#issuecomment-2660636760&lt;/a&gt; &lt;&lt;a rel="nofollow" href="https://github.com/gpuweb/gpuweb/issues/5071#issuecomment-2660636760"&gt;https://github.com/gpuweb/gpuweb/issues/5071#issuecomment-2660636760&lt;/a&gt;&gt;)
/Other signals/:
*WebView application risks*
