&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;tt&gt;&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://wpt.fyi/results/css/css-images/object-fit-contain-svg-002o.html"&gt;https://wpt.fyi/results/css/css-images/object-fit-contain-svg-002o.html&lt;/a&gt; 
