&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;tt&gt;Just to clarify: Mike is asking for Mozilla and Safari standards &lt;/tt&gt;&lt;tt&gt;positions issues, not additional developer signals. &lt;/tt&gt;&lt;pre style="margin: 0em;"&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;tt&gt;On Wed, Sep 2, 2026 at 11:20 AM Helmut Januschka &lt;/tt&gt;&lt;tt&gt;&lt;&lt;a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="aac2c0cbc4dfd9c9848484eacdc7cbc3c684c9c5c7"&gt;[email&#160;protected]&lt;/a&gt;&gt; wrote: &lt;/tt&gt;&lt;pre style="margin: 0em;"&gt;
