&lt;a  rel="nofollow" href="https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/d/msgid/blink-dev/1788253975158.1426691241.2419236902%40hexmode.org"&gt;https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/d/msgid/blink-dev/1788253975158.1426691241.2419236902%40hexmode.org&lt;/a&gt;.
